<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:34,530 --> 00:01:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you there.</font>

32
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Identify yourself.</font>

33
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not obliged to answer...</font>

34
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:41,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

35
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:44,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cute...</font>

36
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:52,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So those are Kakashi and
Guy's treasured brats...</font>

37
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, for the time being,
their applications will pass.</font>

38
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:57,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

39
00:01:59,510 --> 00:02:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears this year's
test-takers will be amusing.</font>

40
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For us proctors too, eh...</font>

41
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then!
Sasuke-kun, Naruto, let's go!</font>

42
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't pull.</font>

43
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... Uchiha Sasuke, eh.</font>

44
00:02:25,660 --> 00:02:28,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does that kid concern you?</font>

45
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph...</font>

46
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, let's go.</font>

47
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?</font>

48
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys go on ahead.
I have something I want to check out.</font>

49
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that about?</font>

50
00:02:47,770 --> 00:02:48,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should I know?</font>

51
00:02:55,190 --> 00:02:57,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, with the unpleasant look.
Wait a minute!</font>

52
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:00,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

53
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:06,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh!
— Yikes!</font>

54
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

55
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:13,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you fight with me
here now?</font>

56
00:03:13,790 --> 00:03:19,800
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Energy</font>

57
00:03:13,790 --> 00:03:19,800
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">A Modern and</font>

58
00:03:13,790 --> 00:03:19,800
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Rocking Challenge!</font>

59
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A fight here now...?</font>

60
00:03:24,260 --> 00:03:25,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

61
00:03:31,770 --> 00:03:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name's Rock Lee.</font>

62
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When asking a person their name,</font>

63
00:03:36,610 --> 00:03:38,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm supposed to give
my own name first, right?</font>

64
00:03:39,570 --> 00:03:40,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke...</font>

65
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph... So you knew?</font>

66
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:46,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to fight with you!</font>

67
00:03:49,250 --> 00:03:52,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to test out how effective
my techniques will be</font>

68
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:56,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">against the descendant of the
clan reputed for genius Ninja.</font>

69
00:03:57,460 --> 00:03:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also...</font>

70
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:05,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san. Love.</font>

71
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:11,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!
Those lower eyelashes are awful!</font>

72
00:04:11,850 --> 00:04:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The hairstyle is awful, too!</font>

73
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:16,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those bushy eyebrows,
just too intense!</font>

74
00:04:16,150 --> 00:04:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything is...!</font>

75
00:04:17,690 --> 00:04:19,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an angel!</font>

76
00:04:21,780 --> 00:04:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

77
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are good at it.
Then, how about...?</font>

78
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:49,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really... That was super close.</font>

79
00:04:49,970 --> 00:04:52,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! Don't throw strange stuff!</font>

80
00:04:52,890 --> 00:04:55,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was dodging for my life!</font>

81
00:04:56,770 --> 00:04:58,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to resent me that much.</font>

82
00:04:59,690 --> 00:05:03,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Sasuke again!
Damn it! Damn it!</font>

83
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:06,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be honest, you're a naive one,</font>

84
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:09,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">knowing the name of Uchiha
and challenging me.</font>

85
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to realize
what this name is, Bushy-Brow?</font>

86
00:05:17,290 --> 00:05:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I insist.</font>

87
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm lucky...</font>

88
00:05:20,210 --> 00:05:23,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to be able to have a bout with
the number one rookie right away.</font>

89
00:05:24,970 --> 00:05:27,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, I'll prove it to you, Guy-sensei!</font>

90
00:05:28,930 --> 00:05:29,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

91
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:42,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am going to take out
the Bushy-Brow.</font>

92
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you...!</font>

93
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:45,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big deal.</font>

94
00:05:45,990 --> 00:05:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be able to take care of him
in just five minutes!</font>

95
00:05:48,450 --> 00:05:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one I want to fight isn't you...
It's Uchiha.</font>

96
00:05:53,660 --> 00:05:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All these people...</font>

97
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:58,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">keep saying Sasuke, Sasuke.
How annoying!</font>

98
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

99
00:06:14,770 --> 00:06:16,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Whirlwind!</font>

100
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:25,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought, he's strong...</font>

101
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:32,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I declare. You are absolutely
no match for me.</font>

102
00:06:32,490 --> 00:06:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because...</font>

103
00:06:34,950 --> 00:06:39,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">among the Leaf Village Genin,
I'm the strongest now.</font>

104
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He stopped my kick...</font>

105
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with that Chakra in his arm...?</font>

106
00:06:53,010 --> 00:06:56,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Interesting. I'll do it.</font>

107
00:06:58,980 --> 00:06:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

108
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Sasuke-kun!</font>

109
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:07,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's less than thirty minutes
until the 3:00 registration.</font>

110
00:07:08,950 --> 00:07:10,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.</font>

111
00:07:12,030 --> 00:07:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be over in five minutes.</font>

112
00:07:14,990 --> 00:07:15,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here he comes!</font>

113
00:07:16,370 --> 00:07:18,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Guy-sensei.</font>

114
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may end up breaking the taboo.</font>

115
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:23,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may end up using...
that technique!</font>

116
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:28,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricanes!</font>

117
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't get completely out
of the way...</font>

118
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:33,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guard!</font>

119
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:36,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

120
00:07:37,890 --> 00:07:38,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

121
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on?</font>

122
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... he did guard himself
just now, no mistake.</font>

123
00:07:56,450 --> 00:07:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He got around my guard.</font>

124
00:07:58,790 --> 00:07:59,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

125
00:07:59,580 --> 00:08:02,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it Ninjutsu...?
Or is it Genjutsu...?!</font>

126
00:08:02,790 --> 00:08:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought, he's going to get up!</font>

127
00:08:06,380 --> 00:08:08,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph... That's okay.</font>

128
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case,</font>

129
00:08:10,090 --> 00:08:12,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this is a good opportunity
to get used to THAT.</font>

130
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it.</font>

131
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! C-Could that be...?</font>

132
00:08:25,940 --> 00:08:26,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

133
00:08:27,570 --> 00:08:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, when has he...
Why is that in his eyes...</font>

134
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:33,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in both eyes...!</font>

135
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that the Sharingan?</font>

136
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:46,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun's awesome, after all!</font>

137
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:51,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this is the same Kekkei Genkai
as Kakashi-sensei's...</font>

138
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he can read Bushy-Brow's Jutsu!</font>

139
00:08:54,590 --> 00:08:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu or Ninjutsu...</font>

140
00:08:56,430 --> 00:09:01,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's some kind of magic either way...
I'll reveal that!</font>

141
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It feels like Sasuke-kun's rapidly
getting stronger.</font>

142
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:12,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's to be expected
of the Uchiha clan.</font>

143
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:18,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...
Sasuke-kun should not lose to a guy like this.</font>

144
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

145
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sharingan...!</font>

146
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To not be able to discern the Jutsu
with the Sharingan...</font>

147
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be... that his technique is...!</font>

148
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

149
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My technique is neither
Ninjutsu nor Genjutsu.</font>

150
00:09:43,430 --> 00:09:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sasuke!</font>

151
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

152
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:57,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My technique is
mere Taijutsu... Sasuke-kun.</font>

153
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You may not be able to
believe it just like that, but...</font>

154
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Punk!</font>

155
00:10:06,290 --> 00:10:09,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's said that the Sharingan has
the ability to spot</font>

156
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:13,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all Genjutsu, Taijutsu and Ninjutsu.</font>

157
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:15,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make no mistake,</font>

158
00:10:15,710 --> 00:10:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Sharingan reads Ninjutsu
and Genjutsu that</font>

159
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">require the principle of building up
Chakra and weaving Signs,</font>

160
00:10:20,590 --> 00:10:22,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and can most surely handle such Jutsu.</font>

161
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, only Taijutsu is
a little bit different...</font>

162
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What do you mean?!</font>

163
00:10:30,060 --> 00:10:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you can spot my movements
with the Sharingan,</font>

164
00:10:33,150 --> 00:10:38,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your body is not equipped with
the speed to respond to my Taijutsu.</font>

165
00:10:39,570 --> 00:10:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, even if you understand
with your eyes,</font>

166
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's nothing you can do if your
body can't keep up.</font>

167
00:10:46,660 --> 00:10:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know?</font>

168
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are two types of strong people,
genius-types and effort-types.</font>

169
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If your Sharingan is
a genius-type drawing Uchiha ability...</font>

170
00:10:56,920 --> 00:11:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm an effort-type who has
patiently mastered only Taijutsu.</font>

171
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a manner of speaking,</font>

172
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your Sharingan and my ultimate
Taijutsu have the worst compatibility...</font>

173
00:11:08,810 --> 00:11:09,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guard!</font>

174
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:23,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Dancing Leaf Shadow...!</font>

175
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I shall prove it with this technique.</font>

176
00:11:29,330 --> 00:11:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prove that effort exceeds the genius.</font>

177
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:34,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's he going to do...?!</font>

178
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my victory!</font>

179
00:11:45,050 --> 00:11:46,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Dancing Leaf Shadow!</font>

180
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:49,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I shall prove it with this technique.</font>

181
00:11:51,690 --> 00:11:54,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prove that effort exceeds the genius.</font>

182
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's he going to do...?!</font>

183
00:11:57,730 --> 00:11:58,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my victory!</font>

184
00:12:00,650 --> 00:12:01,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

185
00:12:04,370 --> 00:12:05,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?!</font>

186
00:12:06,030 --> 00:12:07,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...!</font>

187
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:09,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's as far as it goes! Lee!</font>

188
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is it...?
What's going on?</font>

189
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

190
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke was beaten?!</font>

191
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:33,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened while
I was knocked out?!</font>

192
00:12:37,610 --> 00:12:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?! Sasuke-kun.</font>

193
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:45,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's agitated...
To think he couldn't fall properly.</font>

194
00:12:47,490 --> 00:12:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You were watching...?</font>

195
00:12:50,410 --> 00:12:53,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee! That technique just now
is prohibited, you know!</font>

196
00:12:54,790 --> 00:12:57,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's with that turtle...?</font>

197
00:12:58,090 --> 00:13:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry.
I didn't mean to...</font>

198
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's... getting scolded or something...</font>

199
00:13:05,930 --> 00:13:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could that be... Bushy-Brow's teacher?!</font>

200
00:13:15,850 --> 00:13:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But, of course,</font>

201
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:23,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't even remotely have
a mind to use the Hidden technique...</font>

202
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake!</font>

203
00:13:25,530 --> 00:13:26,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?</font>

204
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:28,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey.</font>

205
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:29,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

206
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:33,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That thing... It's a turtle, right...?
Right?</font>

207
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:35,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it obvious?!</font>

208
00:13:35,870 --> 00:13:39,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey! Can even a turtle
become a Ninja teacher?</font>

209
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know!</font>

210
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:43,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool!</font>

211
00:13:44,010 --> 00:13:47,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think such subterfuge will work?!</font>

212
00:13:47,510 --> 00:13:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should know very well what
it means</font>

213
00:13:49,930 --> 00:13:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for a Shinobi to give away
his technique!</font>

214
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I know.</font>

215
00:13:58,690 --> 00:14:02,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think I lost to someone so flippant...</font>

216
00:14:06,530 --> 00:14:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you prepared yourself?</font>

217
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:10,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes sir...</font>

218
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:14,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, if you will, Guy-sensei!</font>

219
00:14:18,290 --> 00:14:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man! Life treating you good, huh?</font>

220
00:14:22,130 --> 00:14:23,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

221
00:14:25,090 --> 00:14:29,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa! An even more
intense guy has appeared!</font>

222
00:14:29,590 --> 00:14:30,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo, Lee!</font>

223
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Super intense.
The extreme bowl cut...</font>

224
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:38,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Those are some incredibly
raging brows...</font>

225
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen anything like that
in my life.</font>

226
00:14:43,110 --> 00:14:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey! You guys!
Don't mock Guy-sensei!</font>

227
00:14:47,190 --> 00:14:49,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

228
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm at a loss for a reaction because</font>

229
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:52,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of those bizarre things appearing
one after another!</font>

230
00:14:52,780 --> 00:14:53,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

231
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Lee! Drop it!</font>

232
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:58,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir...</font>

233
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot!</font>

234
00:15:16,470 --> 00:15:19,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, you... you...</font>

235
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:21,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sensei...!</font>

236
00:15:23,110 --> 00:15:24,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Lee...</font>

237
00:15:25,690 --> 00:15:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei... I... I...</font>

238
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:32,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough, Lee!
Don't say anything!</font>

239
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

240
00:15:35,830 --> 00:15:36,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee!</font>

241
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:43,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I lost to a guy like that...</font>

242
00:15:44,330 --> 00:15:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... this is adolescence!</font>

243
00:15:47,090 --> 00:15:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

244
00:15:52,220 --> 00:15:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sort of tone's kind of nice, too.</font>

245
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:58,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-Idiot! That's dangerous!
Very dangerous!</font>

246
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay, Lee!</font>

247
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mistakes come with adolescence.
Don't worry about it!</font>

248
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're so kind... Sensei!</font>

249
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, take a hundred laps around
the Training Field toward that setting sun!</font>

250
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:15,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! Sensei!</font>

251
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Let's go!
— Yes, sir!</font>

252
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:33,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait a minute.</font>

253
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:36,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're still in the middle
of the conversation!</font>

254
00:16:36,090 --> 00:16:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you going to do
about the Chunin Exam?!</font>

255
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time!</font>

256
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:43,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Oh, that's right...</font>

257
00:16:45,190 --> 00:16:49,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, you will be punished for attempting
to break the prohibition on top of fighting...</font>

258
00:16:49,860 --> 00:16:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in principle, after
the Chunin Exam.</font>

259
00:16:53,740 --> 00:16:54,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

260
00:16:54,950 --> 00:16:57,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five hundred howls of adolescence!</font>

261
00:16:57,700 --> 00:16:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

262
00:17:02,370 --> 00:17:03,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiots...</font>

263
00:17:03,460 --> 00:17:04,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say! Say!</font>

264
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, what's with that turtle?</font>

265
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:10,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I'm not mistaken, those kids are...</font>

266
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi's...</font>

267
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:16,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! No, he's looking this way!</font>

268
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys... how's Kakashi-sensei?</font>

269
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:21,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know Kakashi...?</font>

270
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know him all too well.</font>

271
00:17:25,890 --> 00:17:31,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People call us...
eternal rivals.</font>

272
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sounds like a lie!</font>

273
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:36,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?!
Guy-sensei really is...</font>

274
00:17:36,150 --> 00:17:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's fine.</font>

275
00:17:37,950 --> 00:17:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Action speaks louder than words"
anyway.</font>

276
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:45,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

277
00:17:48,250 --> 00:17:52,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, my record is fifty wins
and forty-nine losses.</font>

278
00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

279
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

280
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did he...?</font>

281
00:17:57,130 --> 00:18:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One thing, I'm stronger than Kakashi...</font>

282
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way...</font>

283
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast! He's faster than Kakashi!
Is he human...?!</font>

284
00:18:09,730 --> 00:18:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about that?!
Guy-sensei is awesome, isn't he?!</font>

285
00:18:13,150 --> 00:18:14,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

286
00:18:14,610 --> 00:18:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time around,
Lee caused the trouble.</font>

287
00:18:16,950 --> 00:18:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of consideration for my face,
forgive him.</font>

288
00:18:19,870 --> 00:18:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of consideration for
this pleasant face.</font>

289
00:18:22,950 --> 00:18:25,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's better than that Kakashi...?</font>

290
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! He's...</font>

291
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not just all talk...</font>

292
00:18:32,210 --> 00:18:36,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys and Lee should probably go
to the classroom pretty soon.</font>

293
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:45,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He...!</font>

294
00:18:49,690 --> 00:18:52,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, do your best, Lee!
Farewell!</font>

295
00:18:53,110 --> 00:18:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes, sir.
— What?!</font>

296
00:18:58,030 --> 00:18:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

297
00:18:59,990 --> 00:19:02,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have one last thing to tell you.</font>

298
00:19:02,910 --> 00:19:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I actually came here to
verify my own ability.</font>

299
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I lied before.</font>

300
00:19:13,250 --> 00:19:18,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The strongest man of the
Leaf Village Genin might be on my team.</font>

301
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:26,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm entering in order
to defeat that person.</font>

302
00:19:26,770 --> 00:19:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, you are one of my targets.</font>

303
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please prepare yourself for the Exam!</font>

304
00:19:43,990 --> 00:19:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

305
00:19:46,410 --> 00:19:48,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ha! So...</font>

306
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess Uchiha clan's not all that, huh?</font>

307
00:19:52,210 --> 00:19:53,380
